本项目是 ESurfingClient-CVersion 的 Android 移植，协议流程与算法实现均衍生自该项目。

This product includes software derived from ESurfingClient-CVersion
(https://github.com/BadGhost520/ESurfingClient-CVersion),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Portions are derived from unmerged pull requests to that project:
  - PR #37 (Windows-family algorithms), by Rsplwe
  - PR #39 (iOS / macOS channels and dynamic ZSM unwrapping), by MiaM1ku

This product bundles XZ for Java (https://tukaani.org/xz/java.html),
which is in the public domain, used for LZMA1 decoding.
